

$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 -c -o index_hack.o index_hack.cu
$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 -o index_hack index_hack.o -lgomp 


for multi-stream concurrency  

see https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/gpu-pro-tip-cuda-7-streams-simplify-concurrency/

